# V3 background and subtitle style exploration

This folder contains 24 image variants built from the last short style.

The matrix is rendered at 1536 x 1920 for fast comparison. The two selected frames are rendered at the canonical 3072 x 3840 portrait size. The MOV lasts 6 seconds at 30 fps and shows the blue layer first, then the red layer, with a fast left-to-right particle reveal and Canon subtitle timing.

Title variants: SF Pro Display Bold, Alize Bold Caps, and GT Sectra Bold.

Subtitle template: Archive Garamond Bold Italic.

Subtitle colors: white, yellow, #81e1fb for blue, and #ec7972 for red.

The source names are preserved as `img-blue-layer-01.png` and `img-red-layer-02.png`. The prepared copies and alpha masks live in `background-assets/`.

Files:

* `contact-sheet-v3-background-variants.png` contains the complete comparison sheet.
* `font-variants-4k-contact-sheet.png` contains all 6 high-resolution title and color combinations.
* `frames/font-variants/` contains the 6 high-resolution title and color combinations.
* `frames/frame-blue-style-v3.png` and `frames/frame-red-style-v3.png` use the SF Pro title in caps and the selected Archive Garamond subtitle template.
* `video/subtitle-background-canon.mov` is the MOV requested for the subtitle and background animation.
* `video/subtitle-background-canon.mp4` is a browser-friendly companion.
* `metadata.json` and `metadata.csv` record every generated choice.
